  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock id="Tag291" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock id="Tag292" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: calibri;"&gt;During the second quarter of 2026, High Island Offshore System, L.L.C. (the &amp;#8220;Company&amp;#8221;) transferred its West Cameron-167 platform in the Gulf of America and structures and land located in Sabine Pass, Texas to a wholly owned affiliate of Genesis Energy, L.P. Subsequent to the date of this transfer, and also during the second quarter of 2026, Genesis Energy, L.P. divested 100% of its equity interest in the Company to Delfin LNG LLC.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock>
